rooms_desc ({"	Welcome :).  You have just entered the house of Son GoHaN.You are standing in a small hallway.  There are two closets on theleft wall.  Please feel free to use one to store your jacket...anddon't worry, I use LOTS and LOTS of mothballs.  Just then, your nose starts to get ichy from the strong aroma of mothballs!!! J/K.To the east, you see a small kitchen, and to the north, lies myliving room.  Don't forget to wipe your shoes on my \"Welcome\" mat.Relax and make yourself feel at home :).","	You have walked into a small cozy looking kitchen.  There isa table to the left wall, holding my rice cooker.  To the right wallthere is a fridge, with a Sharp microwave on top.  There is also asmall stove and the sink and all the cupboards on the right wall.Straight in front of you lies the window.  Since we are on the fifteenth floor, if you wanted to jump, you would hit the window guards head-on.  Be my guest, but I don't suggest it.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"Entrance Hall","The Kitchen","A brand new room, ready to be decorated",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
