items ({({"mat","As you look towards the tiled floor, you see a black rubber Welcome mat.","closet","This is where I and some other people put their jackets.","closet2","This is my storage closet of junk...but feel free to use it.",}),({"table","A small table with a rice cooker and some cereal boxes on top.","cooker","This is my rice cooker...don't even think of taking it...I need dinner.","fridge","Some old refridgerator with food inside.","microwave","This is a Sharp brand microwave with a turning thingy inside.","stove","This is a small stove with four stovetop burners.","sink","You see one of those two sink sinks.  Of which I only use one sink.","cupboard","There are many cupboards on the right wall.  Inside are a lot of things.","window","You look out the window to see the Hudson River, nice sight.","can","You see a round garbage can...its not in the desc of the room because it stinks.",}),0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
